    question: 'How should you compare transformer quotes?',
    quick: 'Compare transformer quotes on the specification compliance first, then on total cost of ownership (losses, lead time, spares, warranty), not just the price. Normalise each bid to the same rated power, voltage, impedance, loss and test criteria, then assess delivery, reliability, documentation and after-sales. A lower price with higher losses or a longer lead time can cost more over the life.',
